CREATE TABLE reading(id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY, value REAL NOT NULL);
INSERT INTO reading(value) VALUES(25.5);
SELECT id, value FROM reading WHERE id=1;
UPDATE reading SET value=26.0 WHERE id=1;
DELETE FROM reading WHERE id=1;


生产代码使用预编译语句和绑定参数；UPDATE/DELETE 未写 WHERE 可能作用于全部记录，批量操作宜放事务中。

