int bsearch(int a[], int n, int x) {
    int l = 0, r = n - 1;
    while (l < r) {
        int mid = l + (r - l) / 2;
        if (a[mid] == x) return mid;
        else if (a[mid] < x) l = mid + 1;
        else r = mid - 1;
    }
    return -1;
}

questions.raw:
下面的二分查找代码存在逻辑错误，错误在于（ ）。
int bsearch(int a[], int n, int x) {
    int l = 0, r = n - 1;
    while (l < r) {
        int mid = l + (r - l) / 2;
        if (a[mid] == x) return mid;
        else if (a[mid] < x) l = mid + 1;
        else r = mid - 1;
    }
    return -1;
}
A. mid 的计算会溢出
B. a[mid] < x 时应该 r = mid - 1
C. 循环条件应为 l <= r，否则 l == r 时的元素会被漏掉
D. 找到时应返回 mid + 1
